            "rich_text": "<h5>Beauty, With Intention</h5><p><strong>LINDÍSIMA is a women-owned clean beauty brand based in New York, founded by Colombian entrepreneurs Victoria Beltran and Linda Soares.</strong>Inspired by their roots and a deep connection to nature, LINDÍSIMA creates <strong>clean, vegan, cruelty-free, plant-based skincare</strong> designed to support both skin health and mindful self-care.At LINDÍSIMA, beauty is approached as a <strong>daily ritual of care rather than perfection</strong>, encouraging presence, balance, and natural glow.</p><h5>Our Roots</h5><p>LINDÍSIMA was created to honor a connection to nature, culture, and the quiet rituals that shape everyday life. Inspired by Colombia’s landscapes and now based in New York, the brand reflects a meeting of heritage and modern living.The <strong>Cattleya orchid</strong>, Colombia’s national flower, became our symbol — representing beauty, renewal, and resilience. Like the flower itself, beauty unfolds gently through care, patience, and intention.</p><h5>Our Philosophy</h5><p>LINDÍSIMA exists at the intersection of <strong>clean beauty and everyday wellness</strong>. Each product is thoughtfully formulated to support the skin while creating moments of connection and self-care.Our approach is guided by three principles:<strong>Botanical Integrity</strong>Plant-based formulations inspired by nature and guided by purity and transparency.<strong>Ritual & Intimacy</strong>Skincare experienced as a personal ritual that encourages presence and well-being.<strong>Modern Femininity</strong>Beauty that celebrates confidence, softness, and authenticity.</p><h5>Conscious Formulation</h5><p>Every LINDÍSIMA product is created with care, responsibility, and transparency.Our formulations are:• Vegan• Cruelty-free• Plant-based• Clean and thoughtfully formulatedEach ingredient is selected with intention to support healthy skin and natural radiance.<strong>LINDÍSIMA</strong>Thoughtful. Intentional. Gently powerful.Beauty is nurtured.<br/><br/></p>"
